# Repomix ignore list.
#
# Repomix packs the repository into one file for AI review. The full pack
# exceeded the review model's context window: it was cut off part-way through
# facelab/face.py, so everything after that (static/app.js, server.py,
# README.md) was never reviewed.
#
# The entries below are the files the previous review already received. Omitting
# them keeps the next pack small enough that the *remaining* context — the tail
# of face.py, static/app.js, server.py, README.md — actually fits. Delete an
# entry to pull that file back into the pack.

# Backend modules already reviewed (plus the package init).
facelab/__init__.py
facelab/benchmark.py
facelab/cache.py
facelab/config.py
facelab/datasets.py
facelab/matching.py

# Frontend files already reviewed.
static/index.html
static/styles.css

# Helper scripts and tests already reviewed.
scripts/
tests/

# Build/config files already reviewed.
Dockerfile
pyproject.toml
requirements.txt
.env.example
.dockerignore
.gitignore
run.sh

# Generated pack output and dependency lock (never useful as review input).
repo-context.md
uv.lock
